    "number": "Theorem (thm:lb_wiwf)",
    "quote": "For any No-regret learning algorithm A for Winner-regret that uses Winner Feedback, and for any problem instance MNL(n,θ) s.t. a^* = argmax θ_i, the expected regret incurred by A satisfies liminf_{T→∞} E_θ[R_T^1(A)/ln T] ≥ θ_{a^*}/(min_{i ≠ a^*} θ_{a^*}/θ_i − 1) (n−1)."
